1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
ALICE: Morning, Bob. Did the overnight render farm job finish?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
BOB: Mostly. Two of the forty shots failed because the texture cache filled up.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
ALICE: Okay. Can you clear the cache and re-queue just those two before noon?

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,000
BOB: Sure. I'll also bump the cache size so it doesn't happen again on Friday.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,500
ALICE: Great. Send me the final frames for the client review once they're done.
